Package: kilix-native
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: compiled helpers for the Kilix terminal desktop
 Kilix builds a few small C programs for each user the first time they are
 needed. This package carries them already built, so a machine that installs
 Kilix from packages needs no compiler:
 .
  * kitty-pty-broker, which owns the pseudo-terminals of Kilix panes so that
    they outlive the terminal window;
  * libkilix-state, the durable store for desktop settings;
  * the terminal screensavers.
 .
 Everything is installed under /usr/lib/kilix/native. Nothing is added to
 PATH or to the system library path.
